#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0492 expect=violation domain=ADLBC
#note "Exactly one column matches any wildcard pattern (SHIFT1), so exactly ONE expansion (y=1); the Check is seventeen presence calls, 100% dataset-constant, so BroadcastFold decides it and datasetBroadcastResult emits ONE violation from row 0. PARAMCD matches no pattern and is not a partner."
#expectViolationCount 1
#expectViolationAt SHIFT1="NORMAL to HIGH"
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADLBC
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
col SHIFT1  type=Char
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | ALT | NORMAL to HIGH
